<title>JAPAN: Rubin says dollar has been strong for some time.</title>
<headline>Rubin says dollar has been strong for some time.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin told a news conference in Tokyo on Friday that the dollar has been strong for some time now.  </p>
<p>&quot;Our policy is that a strong dollar lowers inflation in the U.S. ... and we have had a strong dollar for some time now,&quot; he told the news conference during a one-day visit to Japan.</p>
</text>
